# Kestrel legacy module

- **No Spring** in `legacy-core` (no `@Service`, `@Autowired`, JPA entities).
- Handlers extend `com.kestrel.framework.KestrelHandler<T>`.
- Register every handler in `META-INF/kestrel-handlers.xml`.
- Customer-impacting writes: call `AuditGateway.record` before `KestrelRepository.save`.
- Mirror structure and naming from `PaymentAppliedHandler`.
- Unit tests use JUnit 5; run with `mvn test` from `legacy-core/`.
